Lyon, Aidan, Univ Maryland, Dept Philosophy, College Pk, MD 20742 USA.
Grossel, Geoff; Nunn, Mike, Anim Biosecur, Dept Agr Fisheries \& Forestry, Canberra, ACT, Australia.
