Li, Xibao, Tsinghua Univ, Sch Econ \& Management, Dept Innovat \& Entrepreneurship, Beijing 100084, Peoples R China.
Chen, Weifeng, Brunel Univ, Brunel Business Sch, Uxbridge UB8 3PH, Middx, England.},
