sleep quality (75.2\% of the students with PSQI > 5) (p=0.005).
Conclusions. Despite the perception of sleep disturbances due to bedtime
use of blue light-emitting devices, unhealthy sleep habits tend to be
frequent in young medical students and worrying because it is associated
