Loneliness Scale. Secondary outcomes were loneliness measured with the
De Jong Gierveld Scale (DJG), social network engagement, perceived
social support, perceived stress, anxiety, and depressive symptoms.
Assessments were completed before training (baseline) and immediately
after the 6-month},
