 affiliation = {Özkan, M (Corresponding Author), Inonu Univ, Fac Nursing, TR-44280 Malatya, Turkiye.
Ozkan, Meral, Inonu Univ, Fac Nursing, Dept Surg Nursing, TR-44280 Malatya, Turkiye.
Gunes, Huseyin, Bayburt Univ, Fac Hlth Sci, Dept Surg Nursing, TR-69000 Bayburt, Turkiye.
Ozkan, Meral, Inonu Univ Lodgings, 41-5, TR-44280 Malatya, Turkiye.},
