Hellemann, Gerhard, Univ Alabama Birmingham, Dept Biostat, Sch Publ Hlth, Birmingham, AL USA.
Jacobs, David R., Univ Minnesota, Div Epidemiol \& Community Hlth, Sch Publ Hlth, Minneapolis, MN USA.
Lewis, Cora E., Univ Alabama Birmingham, Sch Publ Hlth, Dept Epidemiol, Birmingham, AL USA.
Fok, Cynthia S., Univ Minnesota, Dept Urol, Med Sch, Minneapolis, MN USA.
