@article{WOS:001541882500001,
 abstract = {In recent decades, we have witnessed the staggering evolution of
digitalization, which has become a fundamental part of children's lives.
Relational, Information and Communication Technologies (RICT) bring many
benefits, but they have also brought countless threats that are creating
problems for the development, well-being and mental health of children.
It is, therefore, essential for schools, families and society as a whole
to take measures rooted in digital and emotional education that will
curb the potential harmful effects of technologies. Against this
background, the research presented in this article conducts a review of
studies that have analysed the consequences of cyberbullying, other
risks/dangers of the digital world and protective factors. In addition,
it addresses the topics of prevention and intervention in relation to
cyberbullying and other issues surrounding the problematic use of the
Internet and social media, tackled within schools, families, the
clinical setting, society and technology companies, emphasizing future
challenges in each of these areas of prevention, intervention and
research.
En las \& uacute;ltimas d \& eacute;cadas se ha producido una evoluci \&
oacute;n vertiginosa de la digitalizaci \& oacute;n, que se ha
convertido en una parte fundamental de la vida de los menores. Las
tecnolog \& iacute;as de la relaci \& oacute;n, la informaci \& oacute;n
y la comunicaci \& oacute;n (TRIC) aportan muchos beneficios, pero tambi
\& eacute;n han tra \& iacute;do innumerables amenazas que est \&
aacute;n generando problemas para el desarrollo, el bienestar y la salud
mental de los menores. Por ello es necesario que, desde la escuela, la
familia, y la sociedad se adopten medidas que, desde la educaci \&
oacute;n digital y emocional, frenen los nocivos efectos que las
tecnolog \& iacute;as pueden producir. Con esta contextualizaci \&
oacute;n, el art \& iacute;culo presenta una revisi \& oacute;n de los
estudios que han analizado las consecuencias del ciberacoso, de otros
riesgos-peligros del mundo digital, y de factores protectores.
Complementariamente, se aborda la prevenci \& oacute;n e intervenci \&
oacute;n del ciberacoso y de otros problemas relacionados con el uso
problem \& aacute;tico de Internet y las redes sociales, desde los
centros educativos, la familia, la cl \& iacute;nica, la sociedad y las
empresas tecnol \& oacute;gicas, enfatizando retos futuros en cada uno
de estos \& aacute;mbitos de prevenci \& oacute;n, intervenci \&
oacute;n e investigaci \& oacute;n.
